### ==========================================================
### BUDGETS — CRUD, períodos, spent, override, archivar
### spent se calcula sobre las transacciones EXPENSE de la categoría.
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Categoría del budget
# @name cat
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "BudgetCat", "type": "EXPENSE" }

@catId = {{cat.response.body.id}}

### ---------- Éxito ----------

### Crear budget mensual (éxito)
# @name budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comida",
  "color": "RED",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 500,
  "periodType": "MONTHLY",
  "note": "límite mensual"
}

@budgetId = {{budget.response.body.id}}

### Listar budgets (spent del período actual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar para un mes pasado (reference)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?reference=2026-07-15T12:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 600, "color": "AMBER" }

### Override del monto del período actual (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 800 }

### Crear budget semanal (otra categoría distinta requerida si es misma categoría distinto tipo -> permitido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Comida semanal", "color": "TEAL", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 150, "periodType": "WEEKLY" }

### Crear budget con período custom (éxito)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viaje",
  "color": "BLUE",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 1000,
  "periodType": "CUSTOM",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Archivar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Duplicado — misma categoría + mismo tipo de período (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Comida dup", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 400, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Custom sin fechas (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad custom", "color": "RED", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "CUSTOM" }

### Color inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "amber-200", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Sin categorías (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "RED", "categoryIds": [], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }
